    "title": "On \"9 to 5 Day,\" Governor Stein Honors Dolly Parton's Work to Expand Early Literacy and Support Hurricane Helene Recovery - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Press Release ,\n1 days ago Today Governor Josh Stein proclaimed September 25 – or 9/25 – as “9 to 5 Day” or “Dolly Parton’s Imagination Library Day of Reading,” honoring the late entertainer and philanthropist. In addition to her work to increase early childhood literacy, Parton, a native of the Smokies, supported the Appalachian region in the wake of Hurricane Helene with a $2 million donation. Read full article\n4",
